=== the verdict this decides ===
  inv_pf/ours = 13.59 with 86% still MFE-matching. The fragility is an
  OBJECTIVE-SPECIFICATION deficit, not a search deficit: ViennaRNA already ships an
  optimiser for the criterion we never asked for. Same lesson as the ShapeKnots gate,
  on the main benchmark, and the fix is a different function call.
